Question ID: PC_U02_L07_GP_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.TR.6
Question:
A student solves a one-variable trigonometric ratio problem. Which step best supports a valid solution for item  Use item context 1 to select the best answer.
{
~A. Choose a ratio after solving so the answer matches #This choice uses a related idea but does not complete the required reasoning for the stated standard.
=B. Identify the trig ratio, substitute known values, solve, and check the angle or side in context #Correct. This answer follows the lesson concept and connects the result to the stated standard.
